{"id":"b1b2bc1f3d190ee9","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-delta-bounded.md","title":"Delta-bounded","display":"df-delta-bounded — Delta-bounded","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-delta-bounded","aliases":["72-df-delta-bounded"],"display":"df-delta-bounded — Delta-bounded","depends_on":["[[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-pi-bounded-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.3.3.2","source_printed_pages":"102","source_pdf_pages":"114","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-delta-bounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-delta-bounded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-delta-bounded — Delta-bounded"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"95a33888a8fb67bb\" href=\"?note=95a33888a8fb67bb\" title=\"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy\">72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7eb80d584ed5255\" href=\"?note=b7eb80d584ed5255\" title=\"72-df-pi-bounded-hierarchy\">72-df-pi-bounded-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.3.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"102"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"114"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(\\mathcal F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b,\\Pi_i^b\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b,\\Pi_i^b\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95a33888a8fb67bb\" href=\"?note=95a33888a8fb67bb\" title=\"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy\">72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7eb80d584ed5255\" href=\"?note=b7eb80d584ed5255\" title=\"72-df-pi-bounded-hierarchy\">72-df-pi-bounded-hierarchy</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 是固定经典一阶演算中的句子可证性（固定的外部元语言关系）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 是自由变量全称闭包。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a> 中已定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L\">\\(\\vdash_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 取本文件指定的算术语言。这里不再把可证性留作未指定的外部演算。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i^b(T):=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F:\n\\exists B\\in\\Sigma_i^b\\;\\exists C\\in\\Pi_i^b\\;\n(T\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A\\leftrightarrow B)\n\\land T\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A\\leftrightarrow C))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i^b(T):=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F:\n\\exists B\\in\\Sigma_i^b\\;\\exists C\\in\\Pi_i^b\\;\n(T\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A\\leftrightarrow B)\n\\land T\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A\\leftrightarrow C))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.3.3.2，印刷 p. 102（PDF p. 114），把“相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i^b\">\\(\\Delta_i^b\\)</span>”落实为同一谓词的两种可证等价表达；不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 写成纯语法交集。</li>\n<li>自由参数的等价性采用全称闭包，避免将句子可证性接口调用为含自由变量的公式接口。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"95a33888a8fb67bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location