"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_i^b(T):=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F:\n\\exists B\\in\\Sigma_i^b\\;\\exists C\\in\\Pi_i^b\\;\n(T\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A\\leftrightarrow B)\n\\land T\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A\\leftrightarrow C))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_i^b","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false}],"bytes":2157,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-delta-bounded|df-delta-bounded — Delta-bounded]]"},{"id":"09833e5945eb7509","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_i^b(T)$ 取 [[72-df-delta-bounded]]；对所有 $j\\in\\omega$ 固定 $x_j=v_j$；对每个 $k$ 取 $\\vec x=(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1})$，$\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 为标准结构。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-delta-bounded — Delta-bounded](72-df-delta-bounded.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-delta-bounded|df-delta-bounded — Delta-bounded]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-delta-bounded]]"}],"outgoing":["95a33888a8fb67bb","b7eb80d584ed5255","5635e2f9f2823a2f"]}